[{"title":"MIMO","url":"/2024/07/13/MIMO/","content":"多输入多输出（Multiple Input Multiple Output, MIMO）技术是一种无线通信技术，通过在发送端和接收端使用多个天线来增加通信系统的容量和效率，同时提高信号的质量和传输速率。\nMIMO技术能够利用多径传播的特性来实现空间复用，从而大幅提升无线信道的数据吞吐量和系统性能。这种技术在现代无线通信系统中得到了广泛应用，特别是在Wi-Fi（IEEE 802.11n&#x2F;ac&#x2F;ax）、蜂窝移动通信（4G LTE、5G）以及其他无线通信标准中。\nMIMO雷达系统通过在发射端和接收端分别使用多个天线，可以在同一时间频率资源上传输和接收多个独立信号，从而显著增加雷达系统的空间分辨率和性能。\nOFDM（Orthogonal Frequency Division Multiplexing，正交频分复用调制解调系统是一种高效的数据传输技术，广泛应用于无线通信领域，如Wi-Fi、LTE和5G等标准中。多个子载波叠加优点是频带利用率高 缺点是：峰均比高，对设备要求高。\nDFT–FFT 将离散时域信号变换到频域，FFT算法利用矩阵的对称性，减少了DFT算法的计算量（n^2–nlogn），从而推动了DFT的应用\n","categories":["通信技术"],"tags":["学习"]},{"title":"714测试","url":"/2023/07/14/testtest714/","content":"\n  \n  \n    \n      \n      \n        这里需要密码才能访问。\n      \n    \n  \n\n","categories":["opinion"],"tags":["interview"]},{"title":"essay","url":"/2024/07/12/essay/","content":"好想穿越到九月看看自己到底有没有保上，啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！烦死\n","categories":["生活随笔"],"tags":["随笔"]},{"title":"upload","url":"/2023/03/26/upload-newword/","content":"\n  \n  \n    \n      \n      \n        这里需要密码才能访问。\n      \n    \n  \n\n","tags":["学习"]},{"title":"Hello World","url":"/2023/03/09/hello-world/","content":"draft: trueWelcome to Hexo! This is your very first post. Check documentation for more info. If you get any problems when using Hexo, you can find the answer in troubleshooting or you can ask me on GitHub.\nQuick StartCreate a new post$ hexo new &quot;My New Post&quot;\n\n&lt;!-- more --&gt;\n\nMore info: Writing\nRun server$ hexo server\n\nMore info: Server\nGenerate static files$ hexo generate\n\nMore info: Generating\nDeploy to remote sites$ hexo deploy\n\nMore info: Deployment\n"},{"title":"中国科技自立自强的案例","url":"/2023/03/26/%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E7%A7%91%E6%8A%80%E8%87%AA%E7%AB%8B%E8%87%AA%E5%BC%BA%E7%9A%84%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B/","content":"\n  \n  \n    \n      \n      \n        这里需要密码才能访问。\n      \n    \n  \n\n","categories":["课程论文"],"tags":["学习"]},{"title":"六级","url":"/2023/03/12/%E5%85%AD%E7%BA%A7/","content":"第一天\nmelt v. 融化，融入\n\nmeltdown n.崩溃；暴跌例句： to avoid fiscal meltdown, public pensions and health-care provision will have to be reined back severely and taxes may have to go up.\n\nentertainment industry 娱乐产业\n\nincoming adj. 即将到来的；刚收到的例句：The editors polish incoming new stories.\n\nweird adj. 离奇的；古怪的\n \n\nterminal n. 终点站；晚期的\n\nprey n. 猎物；牺牲者例句：the deer has fallen prey to wolves.\n\nscope n. 范围；空间；余地实用短语:broaden one’s scope of knowledge\n\nhorizon n. 地平线；视野例句：This is a course expanding their minds and horizons.\n\nwith the rapid development of economy\n\nthe remarkable improvement &#x2F;steady growth of people’s living standard\n\nadvanced science and teconology\n\nbe faced with new opportunities and challenges\n\nthe inevitable result of social development\n\narouse wide public concern&#x2F;draw public attention\n\na heated discussion\n\nreach an absolute consensus on…\n\n\n","categories":["六级"],"tags":["英语"]},{"title":"六级2","url":"/2023/03/13/%E5%85%AD%E7%BA%A72/","content":"\nconscious adj. 清醒的；意识到的 例句：They become self-conscious and don’t want to appear stupid.\n\ntale n.故事，讲述 例句：The real point of this cautionary tale, says animal behaviourist, is that the lables we put on things can affect our moral responses to them.\n  \n\ndeceive v.欺骗 例句：In responses, the alarmists accuse critics and news repoters of being deceived by the entertainment industry.\n\nirrigate v.灌溉\n\nshield v.防护 n.防御 例句：The concept of fixed human nature has so often been abused as a shield behind which the most inhuman acts are commited.\n\ntoxik adj.有毒的 例句：The water scooters discharge toxik emissions.\n\nconquer v.攻克 例句：It is a society well worth studying, and its effots to conquer gender gap impart a vital lesson.\n\nexert v.发挥，施加\n\n\n\nbe supported by sound reasons.\nplay an increasing important role in\nAs the proverb goes\nexert positive&#x2F;negative effects on\nsense of achivement\npsychological burden\n\n","categories":["六级"],"tags":["英语"]},{"title":"六级四","url":"/2023/03/21/%E5%85%AD%E7%BA%A74/","content":"\nforum n.论坛\n\nmultiple adj.多个的，倍数的 e.g.:It’s a complex system wherein data is copied to multiple intermediate deveices.\n\ntrace n.痕迹，微量，少许 v.查出，追溯\n \n\nelevate v.举高，抬高 -&gt;elevator-&gt;elevation(晋升,海拔) e.g.:The elevation of the room that once belonged only  to servants to that of design showcase for modern family tells a story of a century of social change.\t \n\ntexture n.结构，质地，构造\n\nwool  n.羊毛，毛料\n\nintegrate theory with practice\n\nthe immediate interest&#x2F;the short-term interest\n\nhave it’s merits and demerits(优缺点)\n\nexploit to(充分利用) the full one’s favorable conditions and avoid unfavorable ones\n\ntake the exxence and discard the dross\n\nvary from person to person\n\n\n","categories":["六级"],"tags":["学习"]},{"title":"六级3","url":"/2023/03/15/%E5%85%AD%E7%BA%A73/","content":"\nhalt v.暂停；阻止\n\naccomplishment n.成就 e.g.: Your dilligence is worthy of encouragement but efforts does not equal accomplishment.\n \n\nmarine adj.海洋的，航海的n. 海军陆战队士兵 e.g.: Marine biologists are looking for the seceret of turtles’ reproduaction.\n\nplunge v.猛冲下，暴跌；女性领口开的很低revenue n. （公司，组织）的收入e.g.：Nokia’s market share shrank rapidly and revenue plunged when Apple’s iphone introduction to the market.\n\ncapital n. 首都，资本，大写字母 e.g.: capital investemnts\n\nsizable adj. 大的，可观的\n\nmemo n.备忘录\n\nprobability n.可能性，概率\n\nimprobable adj.不太可能的 e.g.: It does seem improbable that the painting’s unique status can be attributed entirely to the quality of its brushstokes(笔触).\n\nfrom another perspective\n\nlay a solid foundation for\n\nbeyond reproache.g.: ……,beyond reproach(无可厚非)\n\nbe committed to\n\npeople those in favor of former opinion\n\n\n","categories":["六级"],"tags":["学习"]},{"title":"六级5","url":"/2023/03/26/%E5%85%AD%E7%BA%A75/","content":"\noven 烤炉，烤箱\n\ndetect v.发现，查明，探测到\n\ndetective\ndetection\n\n\nfederal adj.联邦的 例：A few sensible federal measures could put the country back on the right path.\n\neradicate v. 根除，消灭，杜绝 例：we will aim to finally eradicate disease and poverty.\n \n\nmanipulate v.操纵，控制，影响From offering classes that teach students how to legally manipulate contracts, to reinforcing the notion of profit over community interests, I have seen a lot that let me shaking my head.\n\nsoar vi.猛增，急升n. 翱翔例：Despite mournful polar bears and charts showing carbon emissions soaring, most people find it hard to believe the global warming affect them personally.\n\nstretch v.拓展，延伸\n\nworkshop n.车间，作坊，研讨班\n\nspotlight n.聚光灯v.突出显示\n\nproperty n. 财产，住宅\n\nharsh adj.严苛的，尖锐的，恶劣的\n\nfocus time and energy on…\n\nboth physically and mentally\n\nbe directly related to\n\nin contrast&#x2F;on the contrary\n\ncannot hold water\n\na mirror of social progress\n\nenhance mutual(相互的) understanding\n\n\n","categories":["六级"],"tags":["英语"]},{"title":"六级6","url":"/2023/03/30/%E5%85%AD%E7%BA%A76/","content":"\npropetry n.财产，住宅\n\nharsh adj.严苛的，尖锐的，恶劣的\n\ndrain n.下水道，流失，耗尽\n\nimplication  n.暗示\n \n\nbreadth n.宽度，广度\n\nmoody adj.喜怒无常的，闷闷不乐的\n\nhandicap n.残障，v.使残废\n\nimpractical n. 不适合，不实际\n\ntremendous adj.惊人的，巨大的\n\nlane n.小路，车道\n\ndismiss n. 解散\n\ngeneral adj. 普遍的 n.将军\n\ngenerally\ngeneralize v. 概括\n\n\ndrift v. 漂流移动，逐渐变化\n\nsue v.控告，起诉\n\nfall into place 有条不紊e.g. everything falls into place when I step on the stage.\n\n\n","categories":["六级"],"tags":["英语"]},{"title":"如何搭建自己的博客","url":"/2023/03/10/%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E6%90%AD%E5%BB%BA%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E7%9A%84%E5%8D%9A%E5%AE%A2/","content":"第一步安装必要的软件node.js和hexo以及git    \n第二步在c盘以外的盘中建立一个存储博客数据的文件夹\n第三步在文件夹下打开git bash安装cnpm并将其镜像映射到国内网站上\n第四步在github上建立自己的特定名字的仓库\n第五步生成并绑定秘钥到github上\n第六步绑定网站与hexo init生成文件\n第七步hexo c&#x2F;g&#x2F;d上传文件\n第八步美化网站，可以改变主题，丰富内容\n\n在此感谢提供教程的老师，并附上原文链接以及B站视频链接\n[这是知乎原文]https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/106060640?utm_campaign=&amp;utm_medium=social&amp;utm_oi=1146016221182029824&amp;utm_psn=1616408315113803776&amp;utm_source=qq\n[这是B站视频]https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Yb411a7ty/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click\n","categories":["markdown"],"tags":["知识就是力量"]},{"title":"六级7","url":"/2023/04/09/%E5%85%AD%E7%BA%A77/","content":"\nmodify v.变更，修改 e.g. Piaget argued that attaining and accepting a vocation is the bext way to modify idealized views and to mature.\n\nmodification n.修改，改变 e.g. Some people refer to such modification as maturity.\n \n\nyou can refer to this modification in many ways: transformation, betrayal,degeneration, and I call it educaion.\n\npetroleum n.油田\n\nflatten v.使变平，摧毁 e.g. If such an earthquake happened today, it would flatten japan.\n\ndemocracy n.民主，民主政体\n\nsin n.罪过v.犯过错\n\ncounter v.抵消，抵制 n.柜台\n\ngrant v.同意，授予，承认 n.政府的拨款 e.g. Granted(当然), there is a little consumers make mental connecton between producer’s savings and the lower price in the grocery store.\n\ntropical adj.热带的，非常温热的\n\n\n","categories":["六级"],"tags":["英语"]},{"title":"学习使用markdown编辑文章","url":"/2023/03/10/%E5%AD%A6%E4%B9%A0%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8markdown%E7%BC%96%E8%BE%91%E6%96%87%E7%AB%A0/","content":"\n插入图片  \n\n方法一：输入\n\n\n\n&#123;% asset_img 1.png 这是一张图片 %&#125;\n\n&lt;!-- more --&gt;\n\n\n方法二：输入，注意缩进\n\n\n![图片名称](1.png#pic_left)\n\n&lt;!-- more --&gt;\n\n其中1.png是文件夹中图片的名称right可替换为left或center\n\n调整图片大小和位置\n\n输入：&lt;img src=&quot;图片链接&quot; width=&quot;40%&quot;&gt; \n其中**40%**为你想缩放的任意比例,固定长宽比缩放\n\n图片链接的获取方法，想要上传自己的图片，我只会将图片先上传到guthub上，然后，复制上面的图片地址，直接粘贴到代码中(感觉这样就很呆)\n\n想要 上传网上的图片，直接复制图片链接就行\n\n现在只能单独缩放或对齐，不能同时进行\n\n\n","categories":["markdown"],"tags":["知识就是力量"]},{"title":"小记","url":"/2023/03/30/%E5%B0%8F%E8%AE%B0/","content":"\n  \n  \n    \n      \n      \n        这里需要密码才能访问。\n      \n    \n  \n\n","categories":["opinion"],"tags":["interview"]},{"title":"新中国史课程论文","url":"/2023/03/26/%E6%96%B0%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E5%8F%B2%E8%AF%BE%E7%A8%8B%E8%AE%BA%E6%96%87/","content":"\n  \n  \n    \n      \n      \n        这里需要密码才能访问。\n      \n    \n  \n\n","categories":["课程论文"],"tags":["学习"]},{"title":"小记","url":"/2023/03/30/%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF/","content":"\n  \n  \n    \n      \n      \n        这里需要密码才能访问。\n      \n    \n  \n\n","categories":["opinion"],"tags":["interview"]},{"title":"404","url":"/404/index.html","content":" \n  \n  \n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n  \n  \n    \n    \n    \n    \n  \n  "},{"title":"categories","url":"/categories/index.html","content":""},{"title":"tags","url":"/tags/index.html","content":""},{"title":"关于","url":"/about/index.html","content":"你好，我是第一个六天这里是「月记」，一个持续记录学习、技术与生活的个人空间。\n我把博客当作第二记忆：写下刚理解的知识，梳理做过的项目，也保存那些不想被时间冲淡的想法。文章不追求固定主题，但希望每一篇都比零散笔记更清楚一点、比标准答案更接近真实经验。\n主要内容\n技术与学习：通信技术、工具使用和问题复盘。\n英语积累：阅读与词汇笔记。\n生活随笔：阶段性的观察、困惑和答案。\n课程记录：学习成果与资料整理。\n\n找到内容首页展示最近更新；「分类」适合按主题阅读，「标签」适合交叉查找，「归档」可以沿时间回看。右上角搜索按钮支持全文检索，月亮按钮用于切换明暗模式。\n项目源码托管在 GitHub。\n"}]